[00:09.80]Time,wish we could go back in time
[00:09.80]时光啊，真希望我们能回到过去  
[00:16.44]Wish that our stars were aligned
[00:16.44]多希望我们的星星曾经彼此相映  
[00:21.48]Wish that we could start again
[00:21.48]多希望一切能重新来过  
[00:28.46]I wish that we'd spoken our minds
[00:28.46]我多希望我们曾说出心里的话  
[00:35.44]Shared all the parts that we hide
