[00:46.33]How do we get here?
[00:46.33]我们怎么会走到这一步？  
[00:48.57]Where do we stand?
[00:48.57]现在我们算什么关系？  
[00:50.87]You used to love me for all that I am
[00:50.87]你曾经那么爱我，就因为我是我  
[00:55.50]Have we just wasted all of our youth?
